1. DEFINITIONS

"Software" means the source code, documentation, assets and translation files
in this repository. "Official Binaries" means the executables, installers and
packages published by the Author in the GitHub Releases of this repository.
"Contribution" means anything you submit to the Author for inclusion in the
Software (code, translations, text, images), for example through a pull
request.

2. WHAT YOU MAY DO

a) Read. You may view, read, study and audit the Software, online or in a
