b) create or distribute derivative works of the Software, or use any part of
   it in another project, product or service;
c) distribute your own builds of the Software, or modified versions of the
   Official Binaries;
d) use the Software, or any part of it, to train, fine-tune or evaluate
   machine-learning models;
e) remove or alter copyright, license or attribution notices;
f) use the Author's name, the program's name or its icon to suggest that a
